{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JHN",
  "chapter": 15,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am the true vine, and my Father is the husbandman.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Every branch in me that beareth not fruit, he taketh away; and every ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "branch",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " that beareth fruit, he cleaneth it, that it my bring forth more fruit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now ye are clean through the word which I have spoken to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Abide in me, and I in you. As the branch cannot bear fruit of itself, except it abide in the vine: no more can ye, except ye abide in me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I am the vine, ye ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the branches: He that abideth in me, and I in him, the same bringeth forth much fruit: for without me ye can do nothing.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If a man abideth not in me, he is cast forth as a branch, and is withered: and men gather them, and cast ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " into the fire, and they are burned.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If ye abide in me, and my words abide in you, ye may ask what ye will, and it shall be done to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In this is my Father glorified, that ye bear much fruit; so shall ye be my disciples.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As the Father hath loved me, so have I loved you: continue ye in my love.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If ye keep my commandments, ye shall abide in my love; even as I have kept my Father's commandments, and abide in his love.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These things have I spoken to you, that my joy may remain in you, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " your joy may be full.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This is my commandment, That ye love one another, as I have loved you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Greater love hath no man than this, that a man lay down his life for his friends.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye are my friends, if ye do whatever I command you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Henceforth I call you not servants; for the servant knoweth not what his lord doeth: but I have called you friends; for all things that I have heard from my Father, I have made known to you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ye have not chosen me, but I have chosen you, and ordained you, that ye should go and bring forth fruit, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " your fruit should remain: that whatever ye shall ask of the Father in my name, he may give it you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These things I command you, that ye love one another.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If the world hateth you, ye know that it hated me before ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it hated",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If ye were of the world, the world would love its own: but because ye are not of the world, but I have chosen you out of the world, therefore the world hateth you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Remember the word that I said to you, The servant is not greater than his lord. If they have persecuted me, they will also persecute you: if they have kept my saying, they will keep yours also.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But all these things will they do to you for my name's sake, because they know not him that sent me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I had not come and spoken to them, they had not had sin: but now they have no cloke for their sin.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that hateth me, hateth my Father also.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If I had not done among them the works which no other man hath done, they had not had sin: but now have they both seen, and hated both me and my Father.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this cometh to pass",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", that the word might be fulfilled that is written in their law, They hated me without a cause.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But when the Comforter is come, whom I will send to you from the Father, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the Spirit of truth, who proceedeth from the Father, he will testify concerning me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JHN.15.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JHN.15.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And ye also shall bear testimony, because ye have been with me from the beginning.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
